    Breaking a big problem into smaller steps can make it easier.
  </div>
</div>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h3>⭐ Helpful Learning Websites</h3>

<a class="resource" href="https://www.khanacademy.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Khan Academy</a>

